   219	### 2.2 Node-second block `U_s`
   220	
   221	For `s=2` the fibre is
   222	
   223	```text
   224	(-2)_1 - (-1)_2 - (-2)_1,                              (2.5)
   225	```
   226	
   227	where subscripts are `beta`.  Its two `-2` vertices give two distinct `A1`
