   234	In both families the full fibre intersection matrix `Q_t` satisfies
   235	
   236	```text
   237	Q_t beta=0,       gcd(beta_v)=1,
   238	sum_(C_v^2=-1) beta_v=2.                               (2.6)
   239	```
